 "remarks": "1936 Vintage Colonial Home is sited high on over 6 acres of private land in the estate section of New Canaan located in the West School District. The home features 5 bedrooms and 4 1/2 baths, a gourmet country kitchen, generous sized rooms, and lots of vintage charm. The beautiful professionally landscaped property has seasonal water views of the Laurel Reservoir and includes a pool and spa, a flagstone patio, and a covered porch. The 3-car garage offers a finished space above that could be used as an additional bedroom, gym, studio/office, or pool house. A very special and unique offering. Sold 'as-is.'",
